    // let the total sum be S
    // then you have gcd(x_i, S - x_i) != 1 <=> gcd(x_i, S) != 1
    // however you have gcd(x_1, x_2, ...) = 1
    //
    // pick some S which is not coprime with and choose N of them that sum with it
    // x - totient(x) <= n
    // then fix with knapsack dp?

    // 2 5 63
    // gets you 70
    // keep adding multiples of 2?

